Algorithms
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The solar and lunar position routines in src/core/astro.js follow the
low-precision series published in the Astronomical Almanac and in Jean Meeus,
"Astronomical Algorithms", arranged as in suncalc
(https://github.com/mourner/suncalc, BSD-2-Clause). The implementation here is
original; only the mathematics is shared.
